22 0 obj
<<
/A 256 0 R
/Alt (Timeline infographic detailing a phased plan over 15 years. Phase 1 \(1-3 years\) focuses on workforce training and hazard protocols with an HRC testbed. Phase 2 \(3-7 years\) involves AI-driven workforce training, cross-sector standards, and ISRU integration with 3D printing. Phase 3 \(7-15 years\) targets global standards for safety, ethics, and interoperability, with a living lab and launch academics. Each phase is depicted with illustrative graphics showing different technology and training setups.)
/K 0
/P 7 0 R
/Pg 18 0 R
/S /Figure
/T (Figure)
>>
